    "name": "Cats & Critters: A Dungeon Claw-er",
    "steam_appid": 3464080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464080/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1740169166\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>&quot;Cats &amp; Critters: A Dungeon Claw-er&quot; is an enchanting party game that casts up to four players as cat wizards working together to defeat the evil dragon Frank and recover the golden yarn. This whimsical, pick-up-and-play experience captures the essence of miniature tabletop adventures with its simple controls and low-poly art style. Grab a few friends to help you defeat pesky critters, solve some puzzles, and earn magical loot. Along the way, use a variety of spells and collect the most sparkles to prove that you\u2019re the coolest cat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464080/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1740169166\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play solo or recruit up to three friends in local couch co-op!<br></li><li>Explore an ever-changing archipelago with new layouts each time you play!<br></li><li>Discover all 18 whimsical spells and cast them to defeat your enemies!<br></li><li>Compete for sparkle points along your adventure to achieve the highest score!<br></li><li>Customize your cat wizard with 19 fun accessories and tons of possibilities!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464080/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1740169166\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464080/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1740169166\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>&quot;Cats &amp; Critters: A Dungeon Claw-er&quot; is an enchanting party game that casts up to four players as cat wizards working together to defeat the evil dragon Frank and recover the golden yarn. This whimsical, pick-up-and-play experience captures the essence of miniature tabletop adventures with its simple controls and low-poly art style. Grab a few friends to help you defeat pesky critters, solve some puzzles, and earn magical loot. Along the way, use a variety of spells and collect the most sparkles to prove that you\u2019re the coolest cat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464080/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1740169166\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play solo or recruit up to three friends in local couch co-op!<br></li><li>Explore an ever-changing archipelago with new layouts each time you play!<br></li><li>Discover all 18 whimsical spells and cast them to defeat your enemies!<br></li><li>Compete for sparkle points along your adventure to achieve the highest score!<br></li><li>Customize your cat wizard with 19 fun accessories and tons of possibilities!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464080/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1740169166\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "short_description": "Adventure and cast spells with up to three friends in this local co-op, cat-themed dungeon crawler! Explore a coastal forest filled with enemies and loot, and use a variety of unique abilities to tackle challenges as you journey to retrieve the Golden Yarn.",
